IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sfa-offers-exemptions`

-- Securities and Futures Act 2001, ss 4A(1)(a), (1A), 240, 272A, 272B, 274, 275 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved). Expected results were written by hand from the
-- text.

§ `Fixtures`

-- REQ-0285's facts. The question gives no advertisement, no selling or promotional expenses and no registered prospectus,
-- and says nothing of the angel's wealth or of whether the s 272A statement was given; both offers are taken to be on terms
-- of a single subscription at the stated price, by the investor as principal. The angel's offer is four years before the
-- fund's, so it falls outside the fund offer's 12-month window under ss 272A(5) and 272B(3).
`the issue to the angel for 500,000` MEANS Offer WITH
    `amount raised by this offer` IS 500000
    `amount raised under section 272A in the 12 months, counting this offer` IS 500000
    `persons offered under section 272B in the 12 months, counting this offer` IS 1
    `minimum consideration per transaction on the offer terms` IS 500000
    `is a personal offer` IS TRUE
    `the section 272A statement and resale notification were given` IS FALSE
    `accompanied by an advertisement` IS FALSE
    `selling or promotional expenses beyond those permitted` IS FALSE
    `a registered prospectus stands in the way` IS FALSE
    `the offeree is an institutional investor` IS FALSE
    `the offeree is an accredited investor` IS FALSE
    `the offeree is another relevant person` IS FALSE
    `the offeree acquires as principal` IS TRUE

`the issue to the venture fund for 5,000,000` MEANS Offer WITH
    `amount raised by this offer` IS 5000000
    `amount raised under section 272A in the 12 months, counting this offer` IS 5000000
    `persons offered under section 272B in the 12 months, counting this offer` IS 1
    `minimum consideration per transaction on the offer terms` IS 5000000
    `is a personal offer` IS TRUE
    `the section 272A statement and resale notification were given` IS FALSE
    `accompanied by an advertisement` IS FALSE
    `selling or promotional expenses beyond those permitted` IS FALSE
    `a registered prospectus stands in the way` IS FALSE
    `the offeree is an institutional investor` IS FALSE
    `the offeree is an accredited investor` IS FALSE
    `the offeree is another relevant person` IS FALSE
    `the offeree acquires as principal` IS TRUE

`the issue to the venture fund with the section 272A statement` MEANS Offer WITH
